title: Surprising or precise situations in which to use headlights?
pid: 9811734b-489b-47ec-ae73-6b4f86c110c6
body: |2-
  - When it is too dark to see from 1,000 feet away.
  - On mountain roads (even on sunny days).
  - When the sun is low on the horizon.
